<title>UK: Atmel unit prices $150 million convertible.</title>
<headline>Atmel unit prices $150 million convertible.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible bond has been priced, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The deal was launched on May 14.</p>
<p> BORROWER  *ATMEL S.A.</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON    *3.25	MATURITY   *01.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 CONV PREMIUM   42 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES *COUPON STEPS-UP TO 8.25 PCT AFTER THREE YEARS IF ISSUE</p>
<p>	  IS NOT CALLED AT 102.00 SUBJECT TO 140 PERCENT HURDLE.</p>
<p>	  CONVERSION PRICE IS $35.50 PER SHARE, A 42 PCT PREMIUM.</p>
</text>
